    "detailed_description": "Elementalist is a challenging movement puzzle platformer, where you collect elemental orbs that give you powers, such as double jump, horizontal dash, ground slam, and teleporting shot. After you collect a power, it will be the next one you use, so be careful about the order of your actions. Some puzzles will require you to think outside the box.<br><br><strong>Collect movement abilities, and use them with just one button</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029010/extras/f82ab5e3bfb0198db71ea2fd3111107e.poster.avif?t=1743543504\" width=686 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029010/extras/f82ab5e3bfb0198db71ea2fd3111107e.webm?t=1743543504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029010/extras/f82ab5e3bfb0198db71ea2fd3111107e.mp4?t=1743543504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Salvage the Sun Fragments</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029010/extras/31d9c85082f21e6010b78faf95f737da.poster.avif?t=1743543504\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029010/extras/31d9c85082f21e6010b78faf95f737da.webm?t=1743543504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029010/extras/31d9c85082f21e6010b78faf95f737da.mp4?t=1743543504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Interact with the enviroment</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029010/extras/c80b1b9587